<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Surgical Site Infection Prevention Recommendations</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #333333;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  h1 {
    color: #1a3668;
    font-size: 38px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  h1 .orange {
    color: #e87722;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 180px;
    height: 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #666;
  }
  .main-content {
    background-color: #e6e7e8;
    display: flex;
    padding: 30px 0 0 0;
    border-top: 2px solid #e87722;
    border-bottom: 15px solid #1a3668;
  }
  .sidebar {
    width: 70px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .vertical-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);
    color: #e87722;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 16px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .content-wrapper {
    flex-grow: 1;
    padding-right: 30px;
  }
  .content-area {
    border-left: 2px solid #e87722;
    padding-left: 30px;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .content-area::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 15px;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #e87722;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 40px 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 15px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title h2 {
    color: #1a3668;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title p {
    color: #1a3668;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin: 5px 0 0 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .col-action, .col-supported {
    text-align: center;
    color: #5b739c;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 40px 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 15px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 15px 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #d1d3d4;
  }
  .row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .task-col {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .task-icon {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #5b739c;
    background-color: white;
    z-index: 2;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .task-text {
    background-color: white;
    padding: 15px 20px 15px 55px;
    margin-left: -40px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    z-index: 1;
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-height: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .task-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #333;
  }
  .task-text strong {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #222;
  }
  .task-text em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .arrow-col {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .arrow {
    width: 16px;
    height: 24px;
    background-color: white;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, 50% 50%, 0 100%, 25% 100%, 75% 50%, 25% 0);
  }
  .action, .supported {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .person-icon {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .people-icons {
    height: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #333;
  }
  .people-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .person {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed #ccc;
    background-color: #f9f9f9;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <header>
    <div class="title">
      <h1>SURGICAL SITE INFECTION<br>PREVENTION <span class="orange">RECOMMENDATIONS</span></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="logo placeholder">[Logo: World Health Organization]</div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="sidebar">
      <div class="vertical-text">INFECTION PREVENTION<br>AND CONTROL (IPC) TEAM</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <div class="content-area">

        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="section-title">
            <h2>PREOPERATIVE PERIOD</h2>
            <p>PATIENT, CLINICAL AND SUPPORT STAFF AND SURGICAL TEAM ACTIONS</p>
          </div>
          <div class="arrow-col"></div>
          <div class="col-action">ACTION</div>
          <div class="col-supported">SUPPORTED BY</div>
        </div>

        <div class="rows">
          <!-- Row 1 -->
          <div class="row">
            <div class="task-col">
              <div class="task-icon placeholder">[Icon: Shower]</div>
              <div class="task-text">
                <p><strong>Patient bathes or showers prior to surgery with either plain or antimicrobial soap</strong></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-col"><div class="arrow"></div></div>
            <div class="action">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Patient]</div>
              <div class="label">PATIENT</div>
            </div>
            <div class="supported">
              <div class="people-icons placeholder" style="width: 100px;">[Icons: Surgical Team]</div>
              <div class="label">SURGICAL TEAM<br>AT PREOPERATIVE CONSULTATION</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Row 2 -->
          <div class="row">
            <div class="task-col">
              <div class="task-icon placeholder">[Icon: Ointment]</div>
              <div class="task-text">
                <p><strong>Use 2% mupirocin decolonization in known nasal carriers of <em>Staphylococcus aureus</em> in cardiac and orthopaedic surgery</strong><br><em>(consider for other surgeries)</em></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-col"><div class="arrow"></div></div>
            <div class="action">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Ward Nurse]</div>
              <div class="label">WARD NURSE</div>
            </div>
            <div class="supported">
              <div class="people-group">
                <div class="person">
                  <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Doctor]</div>
                  <div class="label">DOCTOR</div>
                </div>
                <div class="person">
                  <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Pharmacy]</div>
                  <div class="label">PHARMACY</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Row 3 -->
          <div class="row">
            <div class="task-col">
              <div class="task-icon placeholder">[Icon: Razor crossed out]</div>
              <div class="task-text">
                <p><strong>Do NOT remove patient hair, or if absolutely necessary, remove with a clipper, do not shave</strong></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-col"><div class="arrow"></div></div>
            <div class="action">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Surgical Team]</div>
              <div class="label">SURGICAL TEAM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="supported">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Patient Info]</div>
              <div class="label">PATIENT INFORMATION<br>AND EDUCATION</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Row 4 -->
          <div class="row">
            <div class="task-col">
              <div class="task-icon placeholder">[Icon: Clock]</div>
              <div class="task-text">
                <p><strong>Administer surgical antibiotic prophylaxis in the 120 minutes preceding surgical incision</strong><br><em>(depending on the type of operation and the half life of the antibiotic)</em></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-col"><div class="arrow"></div></div>
            <div class="action">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Anaesthetist]</div>
              <div class="label">ANAESTHETIST<br>(OR OTHER IN SURGICAL TEAM)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="supported">
              <div class="people-icons placeholder" style="width: 80px;">[Icons: IPC Team/Pharmacy]</div>
              <div class="label">IPC TEAM/PHARMACY</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Row 5 -->
          <div class="row">
            <div class="task-col">
              <div class="task-icon placeholder">[Icon: Hand washing]</div>
              <div class="task-text">
                <p><strong>Prepare hands for surgery by scrubbing, using the correct technique with a suitable antimicrobial soap and water OR an alcohol-based handrub</strong><br><em>(before donning sterile gloves)</em></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arrow-col"><div class="arrow"></div></div>
            <div class="action">
              <div class="person-icon placeholder">[Icon: Surgeon]</div>
              <div class="label">SURGEON</div>
            </div>
            <div class="supported">
              <div class="people-icons placeholder" style="width: 80px;">[Icons: Pharmacy/Procurement]</div>
              <div class="label">PHARMACY/<br>PROCUREMENT</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

</body>
</html>
